<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Christ lives in me, oh what a mystery.</l><l>Not seen nor heard, yet still lovely.</l><l>Beautiful and charming, I can’t stop loving Him.</l><l>Jesus, most precious One to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Christ lives in me, yes, my reality.</l><l>Oh Tree of Life, I eat freely.</l><l>Enjoying, day by day, I live because of Him.</l><l>Dear Lord, You taste so good to me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
